<view class="ew-page ew-screen" style="font-size:{{fontBase * fontScale}}px"><text class="ew-heading">饮食回顾</text><text class="ew-subtitle">看看实际吃过什么，给下一餐一点灵感。</text><view class="ew-tabs"><view class="ew-hit-target ew-pill {{periodMode === 'week' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="week" bindtap="onMode">按周</view><view class="ew-hit-target ew-pill {{periodMode === 'month' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="month" bindtap="onMode">按月</view></view>
<view class="ew-row ew-between period"><button class="ew-hit-target period-nav" bindtap="onPrevMonth" aria-label="上一周期">‹</button><text>{{rangeLabel}}</text><button class="ew-hit-target period-nav" bindtap="onNextMonth" aria-label="下一周期">›</button></view>
<ui-state wx:if="{{loading}}" kind="loading" title="正在整理实际记录" />
<ui-state wx:elif="{{errorMessage}}" kind="error" title="暂时无法读取回顾" description="{{errorMessage}}" action-label="重新加载" bind:action="loadStatistics" />
<ui-state wx:elif="{{report && report.mealCount === 0}}" kind="empty" title="这一周期还没有实际用餐记录" description="保存到日历的计划不会自动当成吃过。吃完后确认一下，回顾会更准确。" action-label="记录今天的一餐" bind:action="onRecord" />
<block wx:elif="{{report}}"><view class="ew-grid metrics"><view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-number">{{report.mealCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">实际餐次</text></view><view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-number">{{report.recordedDays}}</text><text class="metric-label">记录天数</text></view><view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-number">{{report.uniqueDishCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">已识别菜品种类</text></view><view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-number">{{report.unclassifiedCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">未分类记录条目</text></view></view>
<view class="ew-notice">{{report.description}}</view>
<view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-section-title">记录分布</text><view class="ew-hit-target bar-row" wx:for="{{dailyRows}}" wx:key="date" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="onRecord"><text>{{item.label}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.width}}%"></view></view><text>{{item.count}} 餐</text></view></view>
<view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-section-title">常吃菜品</text><view class="ew-row ew-between ranking" wx:for="{{report.popularDishes}}" wx:key="dishId"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="ew-muted">{{item.count}} 餐出现</text></view><text wx:if="{{!report.popularDishes.length}}" class="ew-muted">自由填写的内容尚未识别为菜品，可在用餐记录中查看。</text></view>
<view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-section-title">菜品类别</text><view class="bar-row" wx:for="{{categoryRows}}" wx:key="key"><text>{{item.label}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.percent}}%"></view></view><text>{{item.count}} 次</text></view><text class="ew-muted">{{report.classifiedCount}} / {{report.entryCount}} 条记录可识别类别。这是菜品次数，不是营养摄入比例。</text></view>

<view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-section-title">实际用餐记录</text><view class="ew-hit-target record" wx:for="{{recordRows}}" wx:key="id" data-date="{{item.mealDate}}" bindtap="onRecord"><text>{{item.mealDate}} · {{item.label}}</text><text class="ew-muted">{{item.names}}</text><text class="ew-link">查看 / 纠正记录 ›</text></view></view>
</block><view wx:if="{{report && !loading && !errorMessage}}" class="ew-card"><text class="ew-section-title">计划执行情况</text><text class="ew-muted">截至昨日：已到期安排 {{report.plannedMealsDue}} 餐，按计划确认 {{report.plannedMealsFollowed}} 餐，实际调整 {{report.plannedMealsChanged}} 餐，取消 {{report.skippedMeals}} 餐，未确认 {{report.unconfirmedMeals}} 餐。未确认不等于没有吃饭。</text></view></view>